00013: {"id":"UI67-U013","name":"开场/排列/派出/收回阻塞门","sources":[{"repo":"/workspace/pokemon-essentials","commit":"8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b","tree":"7589c800b61ba13a13040ed0d686979b80a84fd0","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/004_Scene/004_Scene_PlayAnimations.rb","mode":"100644","bytes":23190,"sha256":"ae97c79199a514f951cd96727e6a52d4163fc30ebbd6d5771db4fb165a420f2a","blob":"5df4c2c08d2bcca3063ad9fd104d33df37e75cb7","reader":"/root/ui_full","status":"FULL_READ","ranges":[[1,579]],"whole_file_read":true,"lines":579,"semantic_selector":"pbBattleIntroAnimation/pbShowPartyLineup/ShowOpponent/SendOut/Recall"}],"facts":[{"id":"UI67-F013-01","assertion":"Intro逐次update再pbUpdate直至done。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-02","assertion":"Introdispose后trainer两侧Lineupfull排队即return。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-03","assertion":"fullLineup不等待自身完成。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-04","assertion":"非fullLineup等待全@animations完成。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-05","assertion":"野生先所有DataBoxAppear排队，再Intro2排队。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-06","assertion":"等待全队列后才闪光公共动画。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-07","assertion":"闪光另经showAnims及shiny门。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-08","assertion":"SUPER_SHINY配置另分。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-09","assertion":"ShowOpponent排队并等全部队列。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-10","assertion":"SendOut空直接return。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-11","assertion":"先等已有party动画。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-12","assertion":"清briefMessage。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-13","assertion":"按sendOut首位侧选择TrainerFade/PlayerFade。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-14","assertion":"逐个Illusion对象优先实际pkmn图。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-15","assertion":"ChangePokemon/Refresh先于新派出动画。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-16","assertion":"两侧选择不同球派出类。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-17","assertion":"每个派出done后才更新其DataBoxAppear。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-18","assertion":"完成判断为party队列空且全部databoxdone。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-19","assertion":"局部fadeAnimdone不是独立总结束必要门。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-20","assertion":"正常dispose后再shiny公共动画。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-21","assertion":"Recall先个体回球动画阻塞。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-22","assertion":"再数据框消失动画阻塞。"},{"id":"UI67-F013-23","assertion":"这些硬编码路径不受showAnims总门。"}],"reader":"/root/ui_full","premise":"固定B8/R合法普通战斗对象与默认配置，无插件并发；源请求不证明媒体/宿主，后段失败保留前缀且无通用ensure。","disposition":"OWN_FULL_DEPENDENCY_READ; domain callers/receivers separately received","execution":"NOT_EXECUTED"}
